ENGLISH
================================================================================

The software and documentation in this repository are the final project work
for the Front-End Programming Practicum, D3 Informatics Engineering, Madiun
Regency Campus, Vocational School, Universitas Sebelas Maret, academic year
2026, supervised by Darmawan Lahru Riatma, S.Kom., M.MT.

This repository is public solely to satisfy an academic assessment requirement,
so that lecturers and assessors can inspect the source code. Being public is
NOT a grant of permission to use it.

Permitted without asking:
  1. Reading and inspecting the code for academic assessment.
  2. Quoting excerpts with attribution and a link to this repository, for study
     or review purposes.

Not permitted without written permission from both copyright holders:
  1. Copying, reproducing, or deriving from this work, in whole or in part, and
     submitting it as your own assignment, project, or work at any course,
     institution, competition, or publication.
  2. Removing, altering, or obscuring this copyright notice or any authorship
     statement in any file.
  3. Using this work for commercial purposes.
  4. Redistributing it while claiming authorship.

Submitting this work or a derivative of it as your own is academic plagiarism,
regardless of this repository being public.

Ownership can be verified independently through the Git commit history in this
repository, which records the date, author, and content of every change.

